Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:49.88,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:54.88,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.90,0:01:57.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:02:02.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:06.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:11.47,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:11.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:15.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:14.93,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:15.59,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:16.76,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:21.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:20.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:21.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:22.31,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:26.79,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:30.21,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:32.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:33.50,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:36.04,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:35.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:39.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:41.70,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:41.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.43,0:02:44.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:46.60,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:47.16,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:48.50,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
