Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.89,0:22:17.60,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Dance！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:20.98,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Dance！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.11,0:22:21.69,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:22.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:23.78,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One Two Three Four Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:27.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:26.90,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,手掌向着太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:30.87,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Precure5！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:30.53,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,摆动身体跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:34.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:33.99,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,沐浴在阳光下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,今天也整日闪亮动人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.67,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,all right ！
